; The long text of the 16-bit editions — Amiga, PC and Atari ST hold
; the same one — brought over entry for entry. Only the #g runs were
; touched: a run holds no space here. See ../README.md.
;
; Location descriptions. Numbering must stay consecutive from zero.
; Each text goes whole on its line, between quotes, so nothing in it
; can be mistaken for the start of the next one. A carriage return
; inside a text is written #n.

